<title>JAPAN: Hitachi, others win strip mill order in China.</title>
<headline>Hitachi, others win strip mill order in China.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hitachi Ltd said on Tuesday that it, Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd, Marubeni Corp and Mitsubishi Corp had jointly won an order to build a strip mill in China for Baoshan Iron &amp; Steel Corp.</p>
<p>A Hitachi spokesman said the order was worth about 16 billion yen.</p>
<p>The mill, which will have an annual production capacity of 1.12 tonnes of steel sheet, is expected to start operating in February 2000.</p>
</text>
